  "collectionNotes": [
    "MLX90640 仅合成 ADC/公开虚拟校准向量，非真实温度标定；内部 I²C 与 RGB SPI/RMT、按钮已由 LX6 客体验证。外部 I²C33/32 从机 0x32、蜂鸣器音频合成、光学噪声/自热未实现；G25 PWM 可诊断。官方 V0.7 完整镜像提供未验证试运行。",
    "Populated PCB, hidden hardware, pin1 mating orientation and actual paper stock remain unknown. Continuous label bridges retain exact photo evidence; no invented plastic support.",
    "Browser image decode, matching-angle photo overlay, side view and hardware acceptance remain unverified."
  ]
